Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.26,0:00:03.93,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Shining! Running! Forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.93,0:00:06.70,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep pushing forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:09.63,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,The bond that joins us will never break
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.63,0:00:12.67,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,and its light will shine on the end of our dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.67,0:00:15.34,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Wake up! Wake up! Wake up! Wake up heart beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.34,0:00:18.30,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We are the one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:28.07,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Freedom is our only compass we need. -We are best friends-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.07,0:00:34.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We'll be the ones to carve out our own route.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.58,0:00:39.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We spend all our days moving full speed ahead, -Go east, Go west-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:45.41,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,each day brings something new and we leave nothing unfinished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.65,0:00:51.20,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Every trial we overcome brings a chance for thrills. (I can't stay)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:56.05,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow and each day after will be heated, intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.05,0:00:59.92,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,A chain of excitements!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:02.49,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's right! Shining! Running! Forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.49,0:01:05.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Trust your curiosity, follow your heart
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.23,0:01:10.70,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,and head for your goal, that's what adventure is all about!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.70,0:01:13.40,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's go shining! Running! Forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.40,0:01:16.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Spread open the chart of your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.12,0:01:19.17,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,There's power hidden in the bond between us,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:22.29,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,it'll help us grasp the end of our dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:24.96,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Never! Never! Never! Never stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.96,0:01:30.16,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We are the one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.54,0:01:34.24,Title,,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(500,0)}前進！！烏合之眾大軍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.24,0:01:36.11,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,喂，住手，草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.11,0:01:38.70,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,皮卡大人對自己的聲音非常敏感！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.70,0:01:41.05,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,要是他變成那個形態時發起火來…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.36,0:01:56.09,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:02:01.00,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,那哪算是一拳啊！\N整座城鎮都要塌到我們頭上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.00,0:02:04.04,Main,Fujitora,0,0,0,,我感覺到有什麼很不妙的東西。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.04,0:02:07.31,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,一笑大人，你得快點離開這裡！\N那是石頭巨人啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.67,0:02:11.88,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,魯夫，你能不能別再挑釁敵人了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.68,0:02:15.51,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你看？你自己也在笑啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.51,0:02:16.92,Main,Law,0,0,0,,你們兩個…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.19,0:02:23.79,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,它來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.10,0:03:10.07,Captions,,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(1115.13,100)\fad(667,0)}鬥技場外的\N「廣場」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.07,0:03:09.23,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.23,0:03:10.07,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:13.31,Main,Law,0,0,0,,看來我們離王宮相當遠。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.97,0:03:18.48,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,該死的岩石融合男。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:21.88,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他甚至比奧茲還大。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.38,0:03:24.95,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,要是我知道怎麼打倒他就好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.48,0:03:27.45,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,草帽…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.32,0:03:30.56,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,包心菜！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.93,0:03:36.80,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,海賊獵人索隆…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:39.80,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,還有特拉法爾加…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.80,0:03:40.80,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,羅！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.00,0:03:45.84,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,把我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.84,0:03:48.51,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,人氣還來，你們這些該死的最惡世代！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.51,0:03:49.52,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你在做什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.52,0:03:51.44,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他現在是我船員了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.44,0:03:52.64,Main,Law,0,0,0,,鬼才是！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.64,0:03:55.68,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,怎麼，你還在恨我嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.28,0:04:02.72,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,不，我不會再把草帽海賊團當目標了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.09,0:04:09.43,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,因為我的命是被你的夥伴神之騙人布救下的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.43,0:04:15.33,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,是的，我永遠不會忘記他不顧自身安危拯救眾人的勇氣。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.33,0:04:16.94,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,即使我沒有親眼看到。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.64,0:04:20.64,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我最喜歡聽別人稱讚我的船員了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:22.47,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,啊對了…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.58,0:04:28.98,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,特拉法爾加，這是你的帽子，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.98,0:04:31.22,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,我在鬥技場前面找到的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:33.42,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,讓我幫你戴回去。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.42,0:04:35.79,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,來，往前一步。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.79,0:04:38.02,Main,Law,0,0,0,,我才不會信你！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.39,0:04:41.39,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,算了，隨便吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.39,0:04:43.43,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,我現在可是很忙的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.26,0:04:49.03,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,為了報答你們大家，我決定要殺了多佛朗明哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.90,0:04:50.94,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.40,0:04:53.74,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,一切就交給我吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.74,0:04:55.34,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,你們最好去找個地方躲{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.34,0:04:57.84,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,不必了。我來動手。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.84,0:05:01.75,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我得報答蕾貝卡請我吃午餐的恩情。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:04.58,Main,Law,0,0,0,,你為了吃的而戰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.58,0:05:07.92,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,才怪！別騙我了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.92,0:05:11.66,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,你是想打倒多佛朗明哥，好賺更多人氣吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.66,0:05:13.29,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,什麼人氣啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.29,0:05:15.53,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,你想想看嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.89,0:05:20.87,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,要是我打倒了多佛朗明哥這種邪惡的海賊，記者們絕不會放過我！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:24.24,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,每天早晨都會從蜂擁而來的採訪開始。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.10,0:05:28.81,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,「您好，超級巨星。」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.47,0:05:34.81,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,「能被稱為超級巨星我深感榮幸，那麼有什麼能為您效勞的呢？」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.81,0:05:38.88,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,「卡文迪許先生，能否請您談談近年來的海賊生活？」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.88,0:05:43.72,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,「啊，卡文迪許先生，您還在嗎？」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.72,0:05:47.63,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,「怎麼了，我就在你面前啊。」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.63,0:05:48.73,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,「是這樣嗎？」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.73,0:05:51.73,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,「太耀眼了，我根本看不見您！」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.73,0:05:56.60,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,「太亮了嗎？抱歉，我實在無法藏起自己這身光芒！」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.60,0:05:59.07,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,「太厲害了，您真是一顆巨星！」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.07,0:06:02.54,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好啦，我們走吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:09.68,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,「來，把這一刻烙進你的眼裡！我是超級巨星！」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.02,0:06:18.02,Main,Grunts,0,0,0,,他在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:19.09,Main,Grunts,0,0,0,,找到他！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:24.53,Main,Grunts,0,0,0,,我們找不到草帽的屍體！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:28.23,Main,Grunts,0,0,0,,他不是被砸得粉碎，就是被轟飛到別的地方去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.98,0:06:40.98,Main,Pica,0,0,0,,找到他！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.98,0:06:43.92,Main,Pica,0,0,0,,如果他還活著，馬上通報我！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.45,0:06:47.79,Main,Pica,0,0,0,,我不會讓你接近多佛的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.19,0:06:52.39,Main,Chinjao,0,0,0,,原來你躲在這裡啊，草帽。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.29,0:06:54.99,Main,Sai,0,0,0,,讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.99,0:06:56.39,Main,Boo,0,0,0,,你擋路了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.66,0:06:59.32,Main,Chinjao,0,0,0,,讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.32,0:07:00.63,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那個聲音…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:06.64,Main,Chinjao,0,0,2,,等等，卡普的孫子！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:06.64,Captions,Caption,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(278,0)}八寶水軍（幫派）\N唐·青椒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.64,0:07:09.84,Main,Sai,0,0,2,,我們一直在找你，你這混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.70,0:07:09.84,Captions,Caption,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(278,0)}八寶水軍（幫派）\N首領，雜菜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:13.08,Main,Boo,0,0,2,,我不會讓你逃掉的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.97,0:07:13.08,Captions,Caption,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(278,0)}八寶水軍（幫派）\N副首領，阿葡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.71,0:07:17.58,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我就知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.58,0:07:19.95,Secondary,Chinjao,0,0,76,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.42,0:07:21.15,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,糟了，快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:22.92,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你們到底是怎樣啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.76,0:07:25.96,Main,Chinjao,0,0,0,,你為什麼要逃？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:30.83,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他們就是不肯罷休！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:32.22,Main,Chinjao and co,0,0,0,,{\i1}等等！{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:33.67,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你們煩死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.67,0:07:35.37,Main,Chinjao,0,0,0,,你為什麼不肯等一下？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.37,0:07:37.67,Main,Chinjao,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}頭盔武裝！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.01,0:07:47.81,Main,Chinjao,0,0,0,,你沒聽見嗎，卡普的孫子？我叫你等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:59.96,Main,Chinjao,0,0,0,,別誤會我的用意，卡普的孫子。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.96,0:08:04.33,Main,Chinjao,0,0,0,,我對你家族的怨恨早就煙消雲散了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.06,0:08:05.93,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.93,0:08:11.47,Main,Sai,0,0,0,,我們原本是來這裡搗毀多佛朗明哥的生意的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:13.87,Main,Sai,0,0,0,,我們才不在乎什麼懸賞金。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.87,0:08:17.94,Main,Sai,0,0,0,,那點零頭可不足以逼我們出手。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.94,0:08:21.68,Main,Chinjao,0,0,0,,沒錯，而我已經決定，要把多佛朗明哥打得稀巴爛，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.68,0:08:24.78,Main,Chinjao,0,0,0,,以此來報答你和神之騙人布。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.52,0:08:28.99,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,不，我要打倒多佛朗明哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.32,0:08:34.16,Main,Chinjao,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:37.36,Main,Chinjao,0,0,0,,你是想拒絕我的好意嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.56,0:08:42.80,Captions,Caption,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(278,0)}艾爾帕布的戰士\N哈爾汀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.76,0:08:42.80,Main,Hairudin,0,0,2,,找到你了，草帽魯夫。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.80,0:08:45.47,Main,Hairudin,0,0,0,,我們比賽時發生的事，就忘了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.47,0:08:51.21,Main,Hairudin,0,0,0,,以我艾爾帕布戰士的驕傲，我要打倒多佛朗明哥，報答你的恩情。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.21,0:08:56.41,Main,Elizabello,0,0,2,,我普羅丹斯王國欠了利克國王的恩情。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:59.62,Captions,Caption,180,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(273,310)\}普羅丹斯國王\N伊力薩貝羅二世
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:08:59.88,Main,Elizabello,0,0,2,,打倒多佛朗明哥的人將會是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.29,0:09:05.26,Captions,Caption,0,550,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(273,0)}軍師，達迦馬
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.39,0:09:05.26,Main,Dagama,0,0,2,,正如他所說，我們對懸賞金沒有興趣。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.62,0:09:09.23,Main,Jeet,0,0,0,,不，打倒他的人會是我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.53,0:09:16.20,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(278,0)\fs(42)}吉特與亞布德拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.43,0:09:10.67,Main,Jeet,0,0,2,,我絕對不會忘記…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.67,0:09:13.93,Main,Jeet,0,0,2,,神照耀在我身上的那道天堂之光！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.93,0:09:16.20,Main,Abdul,0,0,2,,讓我們懺悔吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.20,0:09:21.31,Main,Orlumbus,0,0,2,,等等，打倒多佛朗明哥的人將會是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.27,0:09:20.97,Captions,Caption,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(278,140)}艦隊司令\N歐隆拜斯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.31,0:09:23.81,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(238,0)}破壞加農砲伊迪歐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.31,0:09:23.81,Main,Ideo,0,0,2,,我的報恩方式就是破壞！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.14,0:09:27.81,Captions,Caption,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(278,0)\fs(42)}斬首者\N蘇萊曼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.41,0:09:27.81,Main,Suleiman,0,0,2,,處決他的任務就交給我。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.21,0:09:31.75,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(238,0)}長腿族的布爾吉利
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.01,0:09:31.75,Main,Blue Gilly,0,0,2,,不，殺掉多佛朗明哥的人會是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.55,0:09:35.05,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,跑出來一大堆人啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.05,0:09:37.16,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,別忘了還有我！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.92,0:09:42.16,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,又來了一個煩人的傢伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.30,0:09:52.20,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,那這樣如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.90,0:09:58.24,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我們來打倒多佛朗明哥，你們可以在後面支援我們。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.24,0:10:02.61,Main,Everyone,0,0,0,,{\i1}你在胡說什麼，打倒多佛朗明哥的人是我！{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.15,0:10:06.28,Main,Everyone,0,0,0,,我說了要動手的人是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.28,0:10:07.69,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,沒用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.69,0:10:10.05,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,這些傢伙自尊心太強了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.05,0:10:11.99,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你們這些人…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.76,0:10:16.69,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你們全部，都給我省省吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.69,0:10:20.33,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我說了打倒多佛朗明哥的人會是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.33,0:10:22.07,Main,Sai,0,0,0,,你說什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.07,0:10:25.07,Main,Sai,0,0,0,,我說了我們是在報恩。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.07,0:10:29.51,Main,Sai,0,0,0,,你再繼續胡扯，我就殺了你，你這愚蠢的恩人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.51,0:10:30.48,Main,Boo,0,0,0,,沒錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.68,0:10:32.01,Main,Chinjao,0,0,0,,為了榮譽！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.01,0:10:33.28,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,為了人氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.28,0:10:34.48,Main,Hairudin,0,0,0,,為了驕傲！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.48,0:10:35.78,Main,Elizabello,0,0,0,,為了利克國王！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.78,0:10:37.78,Main,Abdullah & Jeet,0,0,0,,為了神！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.62,0:10:43.96,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,長矛？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.62,0:10:46.56,Main,Pirates,0,0,0,,我們找到他們了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.56,0:10:49.16,Main,Pirates,0,0,0,,你們幫我們一把。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.13,0:10:53.87,Main,Pirates,0,0,0,,那裡有兩億跟兩三億的懸賞金。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.53,0:11:00.14,Main,Blue Gilly,0,0,0,,那些傢伙就是跟我們一起在地下的玩具。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.14,0:11:02.61,Main,Abdul,0,0,0,,他們還真是有膽！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.61,0:11:04.54,Main,Pirates,0,0,0,,抓住他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.11,0:11:09.21,Main,Hairudin,0,0,0,,去死吧，你們這些忘恩負義的混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:12.45,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我們走。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.45,0:11:13.52,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.52,0:11:18.39,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,魯牛！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.66,0:11:20.56,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,一頭牛？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.33,0:11:22.79,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我有個主意。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.77,0:11:33.20,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,煙霧裡有東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.34,0:11:36.51,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,一…一頭牛？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.18,0:11:41.11,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,上啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.11,0:11:42.31,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,他在這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.31,0:11:44.17,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,皮卡大人，我們找到他了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.17,0:11:45.92,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,是草帽海賊團！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.92,0:11:48.62,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,他們回到這裡來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.62,0:11:50.39,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,別讓他們逃了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.39,0:11:53.62,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,他們騎著一頭牛。是之前那三個傢伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.06,0:12:01.07,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,還有四個、五個、六個…七個。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.87,0:12:03.74,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,等等，草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.74,0:12:06.04,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我叫你們別再跟著我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.60,0:12:11.84,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,他…他們的人數…越來越多了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:17.81,Main,Blue Gilly,0,0,0,,打倒多佛朗明哥的人會是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.81,0:12:18.60,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.60,0:12:21.12,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,我要幹掉他，就算得把你們全殺了也一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.27,0:12:23.19,Main,Don't know Who,0,0,0,,你在說什麼啊。動手的人是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.19,0:12:24.68,Main,Don't know Who,0,0,0,,不，是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.75,0:12:27.19,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,他們怎麼突然多了這麼多同伴？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.19,0:12:28.18,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,我哪知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.30,0:12:31.46,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,他們全都是鬥技場的參賽者！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.29,0:12:38.90,Main,Pica,0,0,0,,不管是三個還是三百個，都沒差別！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.90,0:12:39.42,Main,Blue Gilly,0,0,0,,它來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.74,0:12:41.36,Main,Chinjao,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}八衝拳奧義！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.36,0:12:43.20,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}鑽龍
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.47,0:12:47.76,Main,Elizabello,0,0,0,,雖然可能還沒完全蓄滿力…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:49.05,Main,Elizabello,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}輕量版…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.46,0:12:57.64,Main,Elizabello,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}國王重拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.64,0:12:59.93,Main,Chinjao,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}…鑽釘！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.21,0:13:15.56,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,皮卡大人的手！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.53,0:13:20.40,Main,Sai,0,0,0,,照這樣下去，打倒多佛朗明哥的人就是我們了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.45,0:13:23.79,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,別再跟著我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.28,0:13:27.28,Main,Everyone,0,0,0,,{\i1}閉嘴，你這該死的救命恩人！{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:29.67,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你們全都說什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.91,0:13:37.05,Main,Elizabello,0,0,0,,只有聲勢，沒有實力。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.05,0:13:39.72,Main,Chinjao,0,0,0,,我這鑽頭沒有破不了的東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.35,0:13:43.57,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好險！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.57,0:13:46.12,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,上啊，魯牛！衝向王宮！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.12,0:13:48.91,Main,Abdullah,0,0,0,,別被壓扁了！就靠你了，魯牛！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.91,0:13:51.79,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂。我不是叫你別靠過來嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.79,0:13:53.01,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,從魯牛背上下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.01,0:13:56.01,Main,Abdullah,0,0,0,,請別這麼說嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.01,0:13:58.92,Main,Jeet,0,0,0,,拜託你了，草帽先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.92,0:14:00.92,Main,Jeet,0,0,0,,魯牛，就靠你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.05,0:14:07.88,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,喂！別讓他們過去！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.88,0:14:09.62,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,他們朝王宮去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.46,0:14:13.92,Main,Ideo,0,0,0,,我來對付你！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.92,0:14:15.42,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,武術之王伊迪歐？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.59,0:14:19.42,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,別讓草帽逃了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.42,0:14:21.10,Main,Ideo,0,0,0,,別分心。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.35,0:14:22.38,Main,Ideo,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}破壞加農砲！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.68,0:14:28.10,Main,Ideo,0,0,0,,想阻止我？那就找些更強的人來吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.35,0:14:30.41,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,這些傢伙是怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.56,0:14:33.88,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,{\i1}歐…歐隆拜斯司令！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.88,0:14:36.28,Main,Orlumbus,0,0,0,,這是我的路！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.28,0:14:37.84,Main,Orlumbus,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}司令…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.84,0:14:39.17,Main,Orlumbus,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}擁抱！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.43,0:14:41.78,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,就是現在！開火！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:44.23,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}美麗之劍！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.23,0:14:45.54,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}天鵝湖！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.78,0:15:01.32,Main,Sai,0,0,0,,往上看！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:05.20,Main,Sai,0,0,0,,又一拳打過來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:08.28,Main,Chinjao,0,0,0,,他真是陰魂不散！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.28,0:15:09.16,Main,Elizabello,0,0,0,,想再來一{\fscx250}-{\r}拳嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.16,0:15:10.89,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,住手，你們兩個！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.89,0:15:13.60,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他能修復斷掉的手臂。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.60,0:15:17.48,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,要是你們不了解他的能力就跟他打，只會白白浪費力氣。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.48,0:15:18.90,Main,Elizabello,0,0,0,,那我們該怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.36,0:15:22.86,Main,Dagama,0,0,0,,既然如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.86,0:15:24.48,Main,Dagama,0,0,0,,{\i1}快逃！{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.82,0:15:27.92,Main,Boo,0,0,0,,這樣還敢自稱軍師？！想個更好的辦法出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.92,0:15:30.00,Main,Dagama,0,0,0,,噓！逃跑可是完全可行的戰略！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.00,0:15:31.62,Main,Dagama,0,0,0,,快給我滾出這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.75,0:15:40.94,Main,Hairudin,0,0,0,,我們不能直接往前衝。唯一的希望就是找路繞過去。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.44,0:15:43.42,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,那傢伙真是麻煩。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:45.77,Main,Chinjao,0,0,0,,不阻止他，我們就到不了王宮。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.90,0:15:48.76,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,喂，草帽跑哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.76,0:15:50.37,Main,Chinjao,0,0,0,,我看不到他！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.37,0:15:51.80,Main,Boo,0,0,0,,他跟那些建築一起被壓扁了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.03,0:15:55.30,Main,Hairudin,0,0,0,,他在那裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.75,0:16:05.56,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,這是捷徑！好！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.85,0:16:08.70,Main,Luffy's unwanted army,0,0,0,,{\i1}他站在他身上？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.81,0:16:12.32,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,上啊，魯牛！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.36,0:16:19.23,Main,Dagama,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.23,0:16:20.88,Main,Sai,0,0,0,,他瘋了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:22.28,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,別搶我的風頭！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.87,0:16:25.52,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.54,0:16:31.06,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好，我們繼續衝向王宮！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.66,0:16:35.05,Main,Abdullah & Jeet,0,0,0,,{\i1}好！上啊，魯牛！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.29,0:16:39.93,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.71,0:16:41.41,Main,Jeet,0,0,0,,什麼事？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.41,0:16:43.76,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,別對我說什麼「上啊」！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.76,0:16:44.28,Main,Jeet,0,0,0,,什麼事？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.28,0:16:46.47,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,下去！你對魯牛來說太重了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.47,0:16:47.22,Main,Jeet,0,0,0,,喔，當然。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.22,0:16:50.16,Main,Jeet,0,0,0,,抱歉這麼晚才自我介紹。我是吉特。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.16,0:16:53.01,Main,Jeet,0,0,0,,而我身後這位大塊頭…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.01,0:16:54.32,Main,Abdullah,0,0,0,,我的名字是亞布德拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.48,0:16:55.98,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我又沒問！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:16:59.29,Main,Pica,0,0,0,,草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.29,0:17:00.93,Main,Jeet,0,0,0,,他氣炸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.93,0:17:03.16,Main,Pica,0,0,0,,我不會讓你接近多佛的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.59,0:17:10.94,Main,Abdullah,0,0,0,,他的手臂！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.90,0:17:14.12,Main,Abdullah,0,0,0,,草帽先生？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.66,0:17:18.67,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.55,0:17:23.22,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}灰熊麥格農！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.47,0:17:27.47,Main,Luffy's unwanted army,0,0,0,,{\i1}他打中了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.47,0:17:28.88,Main,Ideo,0,0,0,,他把他砸碎了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.94,0:17:30.40,Main,Grunts,0,0,0,,{\i1}皮卡大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.43,0:17:37.76,Main,Abdullah & Jeet,0,0,0,,{\i1}他辦到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:41.34,Main,Abdullah,0,0,0,,太厲害了，草帽先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.34,0:17:42.56,Main,Jeet,0,0,0,,幹得好！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.56,0:17:45.24,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好，現在趕快衝向王宮！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.24,0:17:50.08,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,魯夫，你剛砸碎的那顆頭只不過是石頭而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.16,0:17:51.05,Main,Luffy; Abdullah & Jeet,0,0,0,,{\i1}啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.05,0:17:54.06,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我們現在只是跑在一座雕像上而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.06,0:17:55.80,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他又消失了？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.56,0:17:58.08,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他的本體就在正前方！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.85,0:18:15.14,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,啊？那個就是石頭男？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.35,0:18:18.46,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我第一次看到他長得像人類的樣子。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.57,0:18:28.44,Main,Jeet,0,0,0,,他手上拿著一把巨劍！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.73,0:18:32.51,Main,Jeet,0,0,0,,快閃開！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.44,0:18:37.19,Main,Jeet,0,0,0,,如果你閃不開，那就停下來！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.15,0:18:42.82,Main,Abdullah & Jeet,0,0,0,,{\i1}我們來不及了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.95,0:18:52.42,Main,Abdullah & Jeet,0,0,0,,{\i1}牛在飛？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.71,0:18:57.50,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那個聲音真的很好笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.43,0:18:59.46,Main,Pica,0,0,0,,草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.46,0:19:00.59,Main,Abdullah & Jeet,0,0,0,,{\i1}他又來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.96,0:19:02.91,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們先走一步！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.91,0:19:03.47,Main,Jeet,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.72,0:19:08.06,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,好！交給我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.08,0:19:10.56,Main,Abdullah & Jeet,0,0,0,,{\i1}太厲害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.05,0:19:14.94,Main,Pica,0,0,0,,讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.65,0:19:19.69,Main,Abdullah,0,0,0,,這才是神的船員啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.69,0:19:21.57,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,索隆，就靠你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.57,0:19:24.50,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我去把多佛朗明哥轟飛！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.24,0:19:27.40,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,收到，船長。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.45,0:19:32.70,Main,Pica,0,0,0,,我跟草帽還有帳沒算。讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.16,0:19:38.42,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我船長跟你這種小石子沒什麼好談的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.04,0:19:43.64,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你就將就著跟我打吧，你這超大號女高音。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.78,0:19:53.60,Main,Dagama,0,0,0,,喂，那怪物不動了。他死了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.60,0:19:56.54,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,不，我看不見得。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.60,0:20:02.40,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,不過既然他那些煩人的拳頭停下來了，那就是我們的機會！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:04.92,Main,Cavendish,0,0,0,,我要打倒多佛朗明哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.92,0:20:07.36,Main,The Broken Records,0,0,0,,不，是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.98,0:20:18.98,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好！繼續衝，魯牛！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.27,0:20:20.96,Main,Abdullah,0,0,0,,好，加油啊，牛！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.96,0:20:21.73,Main,Jeet,0,0,0,,牛！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.23,0:20:25.82,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你到底要賴多久？！給我下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:28.46,Main,Abdullah & Jeet,0,0,0,,喔，住手啦，草帽先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.35,0:20:33.20,Main,Law,0,0,0,,喂，草帽仔。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.20,0:20:34.32,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.05,0:20:38.53,Main,Law,0,0,0,,我明白我們別無選擇，只能戰鬥。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.57,0:20:42.02,Main,Law,0,0,0,,我已經下定決心了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.39,0:20:48.95,Main,Law,0,0,0,,我最初提出的計畫，是用迂迴的方式擊垮多佛朗明哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:55.05,Main,Law,0,0,0,,但老實說，我自己也想直接打倒他。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.05,0:20:57.88,Main,Law,0,0,0,,我先前輸了，但這次我一定會拿下他！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:09.34,Main,Law,0,0,0,,十三年前，一個對我來說非常重要的人…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.50,0:21:13.01,Main,Law,0,0,0,,被多佛朗明哥殺害了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.51,0:21:20.41,Main,Law,0,0,0,,他的名字叫柯拉松。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.71,0:21:25.56,Main,Law,0,0,0,,他是唐吉訶德家族的最高幹部。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.56,0:21:28.43,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,啊？！他是明哥的手下？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.95,0:21:32.93,Main,Law,0,0,0,,沒錯。我欠他一條命。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.36,0:21:36.44,Main,Law,0,0,0,,他同時也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.47,0:21:42.84,Main,Law,0,0,0,,多佛朗明哥的親弟弟！

